:w-fit"><div class="flex flex-col gap-4 w-full group-data-[role=user]/message:items-end"><div class="flex flex-row justify-end gap-2"><div class="flex flex-col gap-2"><div class="group w-20 h-16 aspect-video bg-muted rounded-md relative flex flex-col items-center justify-center border border-border cursor-pointer hover:bg-muted/80 transition-colors" role="button" tabindex="0"><div class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center h-full"><div class="text-green-600 dark:text-green-400"><svg height="20" stroke-linejoin="round" viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="20" style="color:currentcolor"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M2 2V14H14V2H2ZM0.5 2C0.5 1.17157 1.17157 0.5 2 0.5H14C14.8284 0.5 15.5 1.17157 15.5 2V14C15.5 14.8284 14.8284 15.5 14 15.5H2C1.17157 15.5 0.5 14.8284 0.5 14V2ZM7.5 3.5V6.5H3.5V3.5H7.5ZM9 3.5H12.5V6.5H9V3.5ZM7.5 8V12.5H3.5V8H7.5ZM9 8H12.5V12.5H9V8Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></div><div class="text-[8px] font-medium text-muted-foreground mt-0.5">XLSX</div></div></div><div class="text-xs text-zinc-500 max-w-16 truncate" title="QA_System.xlsx">QA_System.xlsx</div></div></div><div class=""><div class="flex flex-row gap-2 items-center"></div></div></div></div></div><div class="w-full mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 group/message" data-role="assistant" style="opacity: 1; transform: none;"><div class="flex gap-4 w-full group-data-[role=user]/message:ml-auto group-data-[role=user]/message:max-w-2xl group-data-[role=user]/message:w-fit"><div class="flex flex-col gap-4 w-full group-data-[role=user]/message:items-end"><div class=""><div class="flex flex-row gap-2 items-center"><div class="flex flex-col gap-4"><p>Вижу проблему: колонки <span class="font-semibold"><code class=" text-sm bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800 py-0.5 px-1 rounded-md">% грейд</code>, <code class=" text-sm bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800 py-0.5 px-1 rounded-md">ГРЕЙД</code>, <code class=" text-sm bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800 py-0.5 px-1 rounded-md">Сумма</code>, <code class=" text-sm bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800 py-0.5 px-1 rounded-md">ОЦЕНКА</code>, <code class=" text-sm bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800 py-0.5 px-1 rounded-md">Премия</code></span> пустые. Значит, <span class="font-semibold">формулы с кириллическими именами листов не считаются</span> — Excel читает файл, но <code class=" text-sm bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800 py-0.5 px-1 rounded-md">'Компетенции'!</code> и <code class=" text-sm bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800 py-0.5 px-1 rounded-md">'Оценки'!</code> внутри <code class=" text-sm bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800 py-0.5 px-1 rounded-md">SUMPRODUCT</code> не находит.</p>
<p><span class="font-semibold">Решение: латинские имена листов.</span> Переименуем листы в <code class=" text-sm bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800 py-0.5 px-1 rounded-md">Comp</code>, <code class=" text-sm bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800 py-0.5 px-1 rounded-md">Scores</code>, <code class=" text-sm bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800 py-0.5 px-1 rounded-md">Tasks</code> — формулы станут 100% совместимыми. Красивые русские названия оставим заголовками в ячейках.</p>
<p>Присылаю исправленный скрипт.</p></div></div></div><div><div class="bg-background border rounded-2xl w-full max-w-lg flex flex-row items-center gap-3 p-4"><button type="button" class="flex flex-row items-center gap-3 flex-1 min-w-0 text-left hover:opacity-80 transition-opacity cursor-pointer"><div class="flex items-center justify-center size-10 rounded-lg bg-muted shrink-0"><span class="text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-400"><svg height="20" stroke-linejoin="round" viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="20" style="color:currentcolor"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M4.21969 12.5303L4.75002 13.0607L5.81068 12L5.28035 11.4697L1.81068 7.99999L5.28035 4.53032L5.81068 3.99999L4.75002 2.93933L4.21969 3.46966L0.39647 7.29289C0.00594562 7.68341 0.00594562 8.31658 0.39647 8.7071L4.21969 12.5303ZM11.7804 12.5303L11.25 13.0607L10.1894 12L10.7197 11.4697L14.1894 7.99999L10.7197 4.53032L10.1894 3.99999L11.25 2.93933L11.7804 3.46966L15.6036 7.29289C15.9941 7.68341 15.9941 8.31658 15.6036 8.7071L11.7804 12.5303Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></span></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-0.5 min-w-0"><span class="font-medium text-sm truncate">generate_qa_system.py</span><span class="text-xs text-muted-foreground">PY · <!-- -->Нажмите для открытия</span></div></button><div class="flex items-center gap-1 shrink-0"><button type="button" title="Скачать файл" class="p-1.5 rounded-md hover:bg-muted text-muted-foreground hover:text-foreground transition-colors disabled:opacity-40 disabled:cursor-not-allowed"><svg height="16" stroke-linejoin="round" viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="16" style="color:currentcolor"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M8.75 1V1.75V8.68934L10.7197 6.71967L11.25 6.18934L12.3107 7.25L11.7803 7.78033L8.70711 10.8536C8.31658 11.2441 7.68342 11.2441 7.29289 10.8536L4.21967 7.78033L3.68934 7.25L4.75 6.18934L5.28033 6.71967L7.25 8.68934V1.75V1H8.75ZM13.5 9.25V13.5H2.5V9.25V8.5H1V9.25V14C1 14.5523 1.44771 15 2 15H14C14.5523 15 15 14.5523 15 14V9.25V8.5H13.5V9.25Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></button><button type="button" title="Открыть файл" class="p-1.5 rounded-md hover:bg-muted text-muted-foreground hover:text-foreground transition-colors"><svg height="16" stroke-linejoin="round" viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="16" style="color:currentcolor"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M1 5.25V6H2.5V5.25V2.5H5.25H6V1H5.25H2C1.44772 1 1 1.44772 1 2V5.25ZM5.25 14.9994H6V13.4994H5.25H2.5V10.7494V9.99939H1V10.7494V13.9994C1 14.5517 1.44772 14.9994 2 14.9994H5.25ZM15 10V10.75V14C15 14.5523 14.5523 15 14 15H10.75H10V13.5H10.75H13.5V10.75V10H15ZM10.75 1H10V2.5H10.75H13.5V5.25V6H15V5.25V2C15 1.44772 14.5523 1 14 1H10.75Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></button></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="flex flex-row gap-2 items-center"><div class="flex flex-col gap-4"><p>Готово — исправленный скрипт выложен: <span class="font-semibold"><code class=" text-sm bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800 py-0.5 px-1 rounded-md">generate_qa_system.py</code></span>.</p>
<h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-6 mb-2">Что изменилось</h2>
<div class="overflow-x-auto my-4"><table class="w-full border-collapse text-sm"><thead class="bg-muted/50"><tr class="border-b border-border"><th class="px-3 py-2 text-left font-semibold whitespace-nowrap">Было (не считалось)</th><th class="px-3 py-2 text-left font-semibold whitespace-nowrap">Стало</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class="border-b border-border"><td class="px-3 py-2 align-top">Листы: <code class=" text-sm bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800 py-0.5 px-1 rounded-md">Компетенции</code>, <code class=" text-sm bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800 py-0.5 px-1 rounded-md">Оценки</code>, <code class=" text-sm bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800 py-0.5 px-1 rounded-md">Задания</code></td><td class="px-3 py-2 align-top">Листы: <span class="font-semibold"><code class=" text-sm bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800 py-0.5 px-1 rounded-md">Comp</code>, <code class=" text-sm bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800 py-0.5 px-1 rounded-md">Scores</code>, <code class=" text-sm bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800 py-0.5 px-1 rounded-md">Tasks</code></span> (латиница)</td></tr><tr class="border-b border-border"><td class="px-3 py-2 align-top"><code class=" text-sm bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800 py-0.5 px-1 rounded-md">'Оценки'!B2</code> в SUMPRODUCT → Excel не находил</td><td class="px-3 py-2 align-top"><code class=" text-sm bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800 py-0.5 px-1 rounded-md">Scores!B2</code> — <span class="font-semibold">работает</span> ✔</td></tr><tr class="border-b border-border"><td class="px-3 py-2 align-top">Пустые колонки в «Итог»</td><td class="px-3 py-2 align-top">лист <span class="font-semibold"><code class=" text-sm bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800 py-0.5 px-1 rounded-md">Summary</code></span> с живыми формулами</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-6 mb-2">Запуск</h2>
<div class="not-prose flex flex-col"><pre class="text-sm w-full overflow-x-auto dark:bg-zinc-900 p-4 border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-700 rounded-xl dark:text-zinc-50 text-zinc-900"><code class="whitespace-pre-wrap wrap-break-word">cd ~/Documents
python3 generate_qa_system.py
open QA_System.xlsx
</code></pre></div>
<h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-6 mb-2">Что должно получиться</h2>
<p><span class="font-semibold">Листы:</span> <code class=" text-sm bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800 py-0.5 px-1 rounded-md">About</code> · <code class=" text-sm bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800 py-0.5 px-1 rounded-md">Comp</code> · <code class=" text-sm bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800 py-0.5 px-1 rounded-md">Scores</code> · <code class=" text-sm bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800 py-0.5 px-1 rounded-md">Tasks</code> · <code class=" text-sm bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800 py-0.5 px-1 rounded-md">Summary</code></p>
<p><span class="font-semibold">В <code class=" text-sm bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800 py-0.5 px-1 rounded-md">Summary</code></span> колонки посчитаются автоматически:</p>
<div class="overflow-x-auto my-4"><table class="w-full border-collapse text-sm"><thead class="bg-muted/50"><tr class="border-b border-border"><th class="px-3 py-2 text-left font-semibold whitespace-nowrap">Сотрудник</th><th class="px-3 py-2 text-left font-semibold whitespace-nowrap">% грейд</th><th class="px-3 py-2 text-left font-semibold whitespace-nowrap">ГРЕЙД</th><th class="px-3 py-2 text-left font-semibold whitespace-nowrap">Сумма</th><th class="px-3 py-2 text-left font-semibold whitespace-nowrap">ОЦЕНКА</th><th class="px-3 py-2 text-left font-semibold whitespace-nowrap">Премия</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class="border-b border-border"><td class="px-3 py-2 align-top">Слинчук С.</td><td class="px-3 py-2 align-top"><span class="font-semibold">86</span></td><td class="px-3 py-2 align-top">Сеньор 5</td><td class="px-3 py-2 align-top">5</td><td class="px-3 py-2 align-top">A</td><td class="px-3 py-2 align-top">124 200</td></tr><tr class="border-b border-border"><td class="px-3 py-2 align-top">Трошин</td><td class="px-3 py-2 align-top"><span class="font-semibold">80</span></td><td class="px-3 py-2 align-top">Мидл 4</td><td class="px-3 py-2 align-top">2</td><td class="px-3 py-2 align-top">C</td><td class="px-3 py-2 align-top">51 000</td></tr><tr class="border-b border-border"><td class="px-3 py-2 align-top">Коваленко</td><td class="px-3 py-2 align-top"><span class="font-semibold">79</span></td><td class="px-3 py-2 align-top">Мидл 4</td><td class="px-3 py-2 align-top">2</td><td class="px-3 py-2 align-top">C</td><td class="px-3 py-2 align-top">48 000</td></tr><tr class="border-b border-border"><td class="px-3 py-2 align-top">Гончарова Е.</td><td class="px-3 py-2 align-top"><span class="font-semibold">60</span></td><td class="px-3 py-2 align-top">Джун 1</td><td class="px-3 py-2 align-top">0,5</td><td class="px-3 py-2 align-top">D</td><td class="px-3 py-2 align-top">0</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-6 mb-2">Как проверить, что формулы живые</h2>
<p>В <code class=" text-sm bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800 py-0.5 px-1 rounded-md">Summary</code> выдели <code class=" text-sm bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800 py-0.5 px-1 rounded-md">B2</code> — в строке формул должна быть <span class="font-semibold">формула</span> <code class=" text-sm bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800 py-0.5 px-1 rounded-md">=IFERROR(ROUND(SUMPRODUCT(...</code> , а не число.</p>
<p><span class="font-semibold">Поменяй любой балл</span> в листе <code class=" text-sm bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800 py-0.5 px-1 rounded-md">Scores</code> → «% грейд» в <code class=" text-sm bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800 py-0.5 px-1 rounded-md">Summary</code> пересчитается сразу.</p>
<hr>
<p><span class="font-semibold">Открой файл и напиши:</span> что показывает <code class=" text-sm bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800 py-0.5 px-1 rounded-md">% грейд</code> — числа 86/80/79/60 или ошибку? Если числа — идём дальше (добавим лист «Рост грейда»).</p></div></div></div><div class="mt-3 flex flex-row items-center gap-1"><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-medium ring-offset-background transition-colors focus-visible:outline-hidden focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 size-8 shrink-0 rounded-full p-0 text-[var(--c-faint)] hover:bg-[var(--c-raised)] hover:text-[var(--c-text)] [&amp;_svg]:size-[15px]" title="Копировать"><svg height="16" stroke-linejoin="round" viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="16" style="color:currentcolor"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M2.75 0.5C1.7835 0.5 1 1.2835 1 2.25V9.75C1 10.7165 1.7835 11.5 2.75 11.5H3.75H4.5V10H3.75H2.75C2.61193 10 2.5 9.88807 2.5 9.75V2.25C2.5 2.11193 2.61193 2 2.75 2H8.25C8.38807 2 8.5 2.11193 8.5 2.25V3H10V2.25C10 1.2835 9.2165 0.5 8.25 0.5H2.75ZM7.75 4.5C6.7835 4.5 6 5.2835 6 6.25V13.75C6 14.7165 6.7835 15.5 7.75 15.5H13.25C14.2165 15.5 15 14.7165 15 13.75V6.25C15 5.2835 14.2165 4.5 13.25 4.5H7.75ZM7.5 6.25C7.5 6.11193 7.61193 6 7.75 6H13.25C13.3881 6 13.5 6.11193 13.5 6.25V13.75C13.5 13.8881 13.3881 14 13.25 14H7.75C7.61193 14 7.5 13.8881 7.5 13.75V6.25Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></button><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-medium ring-offset-background transition-colors focus-visible:outline-hidden focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 size-8 shrink-0 rounded-full p-0 text-[var(--c-faint)] hover:bg-[var(--c-raised)] ho