flex flex-row justify-end gap-2"><div class="flex flex-col gap-2"><div class="group w-20 h-16 aspect-video bg-muted rounded-md relative flex flex-col items-center justify-center border border-border cursor-pointer hover:bg-muted/80 transition-colors" role="button" tabindex="0"><img src="01-dashboard_files/u-97b2e8de-6213-4531-937d-138b120ca5ff_1790864252429_Ll8y.png" alt="изображение.png" class="rounded-md size-full object-cover" loading="lazy" fetchpriority="low"></div><div class="text-xs text-zinc-500 max-w-16 truncate" title="изображение.png">изображение.png</div></div></div><div class=""><div class="flex flex-row gap-2 items-center"></div></div></div></div></div><div class="w-full mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 group/message" data-role="assistant" style="opacity: 1; transform: none;"><div class="flex gap-4 w-full group-data-[role=user]/message:ml-auto group-data-[role=user]/message:max-w-2xl group-data-[role=user]/message:w-fit"><div class="flex flex-col gap-4 w-full group-data-[role=user]/message:items-end"><div class=""><div class="flex flex-row gap-2 items-center"><div class="flex flex-col gap-4"><p>Ошибка простая: в <code class=" text-sm bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800 py-0.5 px-1 rounded-md">build.py</code> я использую <code class=" text-sm bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800 py-0.5 px-1 rounded-md">Font</code>, но <span class="font-semibold">не импортировал его</span>. Исправляем импорт.</p>
<h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-6 mb-2">🔧 Правка</h2>
<p>В <code class=" text-sm bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800 py-0.5 px-1 rounded-md">build.py</code> найди строку импорта из <code class=" text-sm bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800 py-0.5 px-1 rounded-md">styles</code>:</p>
<div class="not-prose flex flex-col"><pre class="text-sm w-full overflow-x-auto dark:bg-zinc-900 p-4 border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-700 rounded-xl dark:text-zinc-50 text-zinc-900"><code class="whitespace-pre-wrap wrap-break-word">from styles import (TITLE, SUBTITLE, SECTION, GREEN_F, RED_F, ITAL_RED,
                    FILL, SUB_F, GOOD_F, WARN_F, BAD_F, BD, CENTER, LEFT,
                    head, row, mark_fill, state_fill)
</code></pre></div>
<p>И <span class="font-semibold">добавь</span> отдельный импорт <code class=" text-sm bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800 py-0.5 px-1 rounded-md">Font</code> прямо под ним:</p>
<div class="not-prose flex flex-col"><pre class="text-sm w-full overflow-x-auto dark:bg-zinc-900 p-4 border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-700 rounded-xl dark:text-zinc-50 text-zinc-900"><code class="whitespace-pre-wrap wrap-break-word">from openpyxl.styles import Font
</code></pre></div>
<h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-6 mb-2">✅ Или просто замени весь блок импортов в начале <code class=" text-sm bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800 py-0.5 px-1 rounded-md">build.py</code></h2>
<p>Замени эти строки:</p>
<div class="not-prose flex flex-col"><pre class="text-sm w-full overflow-x-auto dark:bg-zinc-900 p-4 border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-700 rounded-xl dark:text-zinc-50 text-zinc-900"><code class="whitespace-pre-wrap wrap-break-word">from openpyxl import Workbook
from openpyxl.formatting.rule import ColorScaleRule
</code></pre></div>
<p>на:</p>
<div class="not-prose flex flex-col"><pre class="text-sm w-full overflow-x-auto dark:bg-zinc-900 p-4 border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-700 rounded-xl dark:text-zinc-50 text-zinc-900"><code class="whitespace-pre-wrap wrap-break-word">from openpyxl import Workbook
from openpyxl.styles import Font
from openpyxl.formatting.rule import ColorScaleRule
</code></pre></div>
<hr>
<p>⚠️ <span class="font-semibold">Обрати внимание:</span> <code class=" text-sm bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800 py-0.5 px-1 rounded-md">Font</code> у тебя используется ещё в <code class=" text-sm bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800 py-0.5 px-1 rounded-md">_goals</code>, <code class=" text-sm bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800 py-0.5 px-1 rounded-md">_tools</code>, <code class=" text-sm bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800 py-0.5 px-1 rounded-md">_rules</code>, <code class=" text-sm bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800 py-0.5 px-1 rounded-md">_descriptors</code>, <code class=" text-sm bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800 py-0.5 px-1 rounded-md">_growth</code> — все они импортируются из <code class=" text-sm bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800 py-0.5 px-1 rounded-md">styles.py</code> <span class="font-semibold">кроме</span> <code class=" text-sm bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800 py-0.5 px-1 rounded-md">Font</code>. Поэтому достаточно добавить один импорт вверху <code class=" text-sm bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800 py-0.5 px-1 rounded-md">build.py</code>.</p>
<p>Прикладываю <span class="font-semibold">исправленный <code class=" text-sm bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800 py-0.5 px-1 rounded-md">build.py</code></span> целиком — просто замени файл:</p></div></div></div><div><div class="bg-background border rounded-2xl w-full max-w-lg flex flex-row items-center gap-3 p-4"><button type="button" class="flex flex-row items-center gap-3 flex-1 min-w-0 text-left hover:opacity-80 transition-opacity cursor-pointer"><div class="flex items-center justify-center size-10 rounded-lg bg-muted shrink-0"><span class="text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-400"><svg height="20" stroke-linejoin="round" viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="20" style="color:currentcolor"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M4.21969 12.5303L4.75002 13.0607L5.81068 12L5.28035 11.4697L1.81068 7.99999L5.28035 4.53032L5.81068 3.99999L4.75002 2.93933L4.21969 3.46966L0.39647 7.29289C0.00594562 7.68341 0.00594562 8.31658 0.39647 8.7071L4.21969 12.5303ZM11.7804 12.5303L11.25 13.0607L10.1894 12L10.7197 11.4697L14.1894 7.99999L10.7197 4.53032L10.1894 3.99999L11.25 2.93933L11.7804 3.46966L15.6036 7.29289C15.9941 7.68341 15.9941 8.31658 15.6036 8.7071L11.7804 12.5303Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></span></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-0.5 min-w-0"><span class="font-medium text-sm truncate">build.py</span><span class="text-xs text-muted-foreground">PY · <!-- -->Нажмите для открытия</span></div></button><div class="flex items-center gap-1 shrink-0"><button type="button" title="Скачать файл" class="p-1.5 rounded-md hover:bg-muted text-muted-foreground hover:text-foreground transition-colors disabled:opacity-40 disabled:cursor-not-allowed"><svg height="16" stroke-linejoin="round" viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="16" style="color:currentcolor"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M8.75 1V1.75V8.68934L10.7197 6.71967L11.25 6.18934L12.3107 7.25L11.7803 7.78033L8.70711 10.8536C8.31658 11.2441 7.68342 11.2441 7.29289 10.8536L4.21967 7.78033L3.68934 7.25L4.75 6.18934L5.28033 6.71967L7.25 8.68934V1.75V1H8.75ZM13.5 9.25V13.5H2.5V9.25V8.5H1V9.25V14C1 14.5523 1.44771 15 2 15H14C14.5523 15 15 14.5523 15 14V9.25V8.5H13.5V9.25Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></button><button type="button" title="Открыть файл" class="p-1.5 rounded-md hover:bg-muted text-muted-foreground hover:text-foreground transition-colors"><svg height="16" stroke-linejoin="round" viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="16" style="color:currentcolor"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M1 5.25V6H2.5V5.25V2.5H5.25H6V1H5.25H2C1.44772 1 1 1.44772 1 2V5.25ZM5.25 14.9994H6V13.4994H5.25H2.5V10.7494V9.99939H1V10.7494V13.9994C1 14.5517 1.44772 14.9994 2 14.9994H5.25ZM15 10V10.75V14C15 14.5523 14.5523 15 14 15H10.75H10V13.5H10.75H13.5V10.75V10H15ZM10.75 1H10V2.5H10.75H13.5V5.25V6H15V5.25V2C15 1.44772 14.5523 1 14 1H10.75Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></button></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="flex flex-row gap-2 items-center"><div class="flex flex-col gap-4"><p>Готово ✅</p>
<h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-6 mb-2">Что сделал</h2>
<p><span class="font-semibold">Одна строка фикса</span> в <code class=" text-sm bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800 py-0.5 px-1 rounded-md">build.py</code>:</p>
<div class="not-prose flex flex-col"><pre class="text-sm w-full overflow-x-auto dark:bg-zinc-900 p-4 border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-700 rounded-xl dark:text-zinc-50 text-zinc-900"><code class="whitespace-pre-wrap wrap-break-word">from openpyxl.styles import Font   # ← добавлено
</code></pre></div>
<p>Причина ошибки: ты использовал <code class=" text-sm bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800 py-0.5 px-1 rounded-md">Font(...)</code> в <code class=" text-sm bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800 py-0.5 px-1 rounded-md">_goals</code>, <code class=" text-sm bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800 py-0.5 px-1 rounded-md">_tools</code>, <code class=" text-sm bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800 py-0.5 px-1 rounded-md">_descriptors</code>, <code class=" text-sm bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800 py-0.5 px-1 rounded-md">_dashboard</code> и др., но <code class=" text-sm bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800 py-0.5 px-1 rounded-md">styles.py</code> экспортирует <code class=" text-sm bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800 py-0.5 px-1 rounded-md">H_FONT</code>, <code class=" text-sm bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800 py-0.5 px-1 rounded-md">TITLE</code>, <code class=" text-sm bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800 py-0.5 px-1 rounded-md">GREEN_F</code>... — <span class="font-semibold">а сам класс <code class=" text-sm bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800 py-0.5 px-1 rounded-md">Font</code> нет</span>. Поэтому Python и падал на <code class=" text-sm bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800 py-0.5 px-1 rounded-md">NameError</code>.</p>
<h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-6 mb-2">Запусти снова</h2>
<div class="not-prose flex flex-col"><pre class="text-sm w-full overflow-x-auto dark:bg-zinc-900 p-4 border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-700 rounded-xl dark:text-zinc-50 text-zinc-900"><code class="whitespace-pre-wrap wrap-break-word">python3 run.py
</code></pre></div>
