<p>Давай сделаю правильно: <span class="font-semibold">Streamlit-приложение</span> как отдельный проект с нормальной структурой, README, скриншотами и <code class=" text-sm bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800 py-0.5 px-1 rounded-md">.gitignore</code> — чтобы его можно было просто <code class=" text-sm bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800 py-0.5 px-1 rounded-md">git push</code> и показать рекрутеру.</p>
<p>Вот полный скелет проекта (7 файлов):</p></div></div></div><div><div class="bg-background border rounded-2xl w-full max-w-lg flex flex-row items-center gap-3 p-4"><button type="button" class="flex flex-row items-center gap-3 flex-1 min-w-0 text-left hover:opacity-80 transition-opacity cursor-pointer"><div class="flex items-center justify-center size-10 rounded-lg bg-muted shrink-0"><span class="text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-400"><svg height="20" stroke-linejoin="round" viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="20" style="color:currentcolor"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M4.21969 12.5303L4.75002 13.0607L5.81068 12L5.28035 11.4697L1.81068 7.99999L5.28035 4.53032L5.81068 3.99999L4.75002 2.93933L4.21969 3.46966L0.39647 7.29289C0.00594562 7.68341 0.00594562 8.31658 0.39647 8.7071L4.21969 12.5303ZM11.7804 12.5303L11.25 13.0607L10.1894 12L10.7197 11.4697L14.1894 7.99999L10.7197 4.53032L10.1894 3.99999L11.25 2.93933L11.7804 3.46966L15.6036 7.29289C15.9941 7.68341 15.9941 8.31658 15.6036 8.7071L11.7804 12.5303Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></span></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-0.5 min-w-0"><span class="font-medium text-sm truncate">README.md</span><span class="text-xs text-muted-foreground">MD · <!-- -->Нажмите для открытия</span></div></button><div class="flex items-center gap-1 shrink-0"><button type="button" title="Скачать файл" class="p-1.5 rounded-md hover:bg-muted text-muted-foreground hover:text-foreground transition-colors disabled:opacity-40 disabled:cursor-not-allowed"><svg height="16" stroke-linejoin="round" viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="16" style="color:currentcolor"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M8.75 1V1.75V8.68934L10.7197 6.71967L11.25 6.18934L12.3107 7.25L11.7803 7.78033L8.70711 10.8536C8.31658 11.2441 7.68342 11.2441 7.29289 10.8536L4.21967 7.78033L3.68934 7.25L4.75 6.18934L5.28033 6.71967L7.25 8.68934V1.75V1H8.75ZM13.5 9.25V13.5H2.5V9.25V8.5H1V9.25V14C1 14.5523 1.44771 15 2 15H14C14.5523 15 15 14.5523 15 14V9.25V8.5H13.5V