="evenodd" d="M2.75 0.5C1.7835 0.5 1 1.2835 1 2.25V9.75C1 10.7165 1.7835 11.5 2.75 11.5H3.75H4.5V10H3.75H2.75C2.61193 10 2.5 9.88807 2.5 9.75V2.25C2.5 2.11193 2.61193 2 2.75 2H8.25C8.38807 2 8.5 2.11193 8.5 2.25V3H10V2.25C10 1.2835 9.2165 0.5 8.25 0.5H2.75ZM7.75 4.5C6.7835 4.5 6 5.2835 6 6.25V13.75C6 14.7165 6.7835 15.5 7.75 15.5H13.25C14.2165 15.5 15 14.7165 15 13.75V6.25C15 5.2835 14.2165 4.5 13.25 4.5H7.75ZM7.5 6.25C7.5 6.11193 7.61193 6 7.75 6H13.25C13.3881 6 13.5 6.11193 13.5 6.25V13.75C13.5 13.8881 13.3881 14 13.25 14H7.75C7.61193 14 7.5 13.8881 7.5 13.75V6.25Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></button><div class="flex flex-col gap-4 editorial-user-bubble border border-[var(--c-hair)] bg-[var(--c-panel)] text-[var(--c-text)] px-5 py-3.5 rounded-[20px] rounded-br-[8px]"><p>еще надо поправить фио сотрудников на обстрактные иванов петров сидоров</p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="w-full mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 group/message" data-role="assistant" style="opacity: 1; transform: none;"><div class="flex gap-4 w-full group-data-[role=user]/message:ml-auto group-data-[role=user]/message:max-w-2xl group-data-[role=user]/message:w-fit"><div class="flex flex-col gap-4 w-full group-data-[role=user]/message:items-end"><div class=""><div class="flex flex-row gap-2 items-center"><div class="flex flex-col gap-4"><p>Отличная идея — для портфолио <span class="font-semibold">абстрактные ФИО обязательны</span> (нельзя светить реальных коллег). Меняю на Иванова / Петрова / Сидорова + добавлю четвёртого для полноты картины.</p>
<p>Обновляю <code class=" text-sm bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800 py-0.5 px-1 rounded-md">config.py</code> — там хранятся все имена:</p></div></div></div><div><div class="bg-background border rounded-2xl w-full max-w-lg flex flex-row items-center gap-3 p-4"><button type="button" class="flex flex-row items-center gap-3 flex-1 min-w-0 text-left hover:opacity-80 transition-opacity cursor-pointer"><div class="flex items-center justify-center size-10 rounded-lg bg-muted shrink-0"><span class="text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-400"><svg height="20" stroke-linejoin="round" viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="20" style="color:currentcolor"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M4.21969 12.5303L4.75002 13.0607L5.81068 12L5.28035 11.4697L1.81068 7.99999L5.28035 4.53032L5.81068 3.99999L4.75002 2.93933L4.21969 3.46966L0.39647 7.29289C0.00594562 7.68341 0.00594562 8.31658 0.39647 8.7071L4.21969 12.5303ZM11.7804 12.5303L11.25 13.0607L10.1894 12L10.7197 11.4697L14.1894 7.99999L10.7197 4.53032L10.1894 3.99999L11.25 2.93933L11.7804 3.46966L15.6036 7.29289C15.9941 7.68341 15.9941 8.31658 15.6036 8.7071L11.7804 12.5303Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></span></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-0.5 min-w-0"><span class="font-medium text-sm truncate">config.py</span><span class="text-xs text-muted-foreground">PY · <!-- -->Нажмите для открытия</span></div></button><div class="flex items-center gap-1 shrink-0"><button type="button" title="Скачать файл" class="p-1.5 rounded-md hover:bg-muted text-muted-foreground hover:text-foreground transition-colors disabled:opacity-40 disabled:cursor-not-allowed"><svg height="16" stroke-linejoin="round" viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="16" style="color:currentcolor"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M8.75 1V1.75V8.68934L10.7197 6.71967L11.25 6.18934L12.3107 7.25L11.7803 7.78033L8.70711 10.8536C8.31658 11.2441 7.68342 11.2441 7.29289 10.8536L4.21967 7.78033L3.68934 7.25L4.75 6.18934L5.28033 6.71967L7.25 8.68934V1.75V1H8.75ZM13.5 9.25V13.5H2.5V9