er]/message:items-end"><div class="flex flex-row justify-end gap-2"><div class="flex flex-col gap-2"><div class="group w-20 h-16 aspect-video bg-muted rounded-md relative flex flex-col items-center justify-center border border-border cursor-pointer hover:bg-muted/80 transition-colors" role="button" tabindex="0"><img src="01-dashboard_files/u-1f4e1304-bcdf-4057-81dd-8656e8a66814_1790928303903_Ll8y.png" alt="изображение.png" class="rounded-md size-full object-cover" loading="lazy" fetchpriority="low"></div><div class="text-xs text-zinc-500 max-w-16 truncate" title="изображение.png">изображение.png</div></div></div><div class=""><div class="flex flex-row gap-2 items-center"></div></div></div></div></div><div class="w-full mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 group/message" data-role="assistant" style="opacity: 1; transform: none;"><div class="flex gap-4 w-full group-data-[role=user]/message:ml-auto group-data-[role=user]/message:max-w-2xl group-data-[role=user]/message:w-fit"><div class="flex flex-col gap-4 w-full group-data-[role=user]/message:items-end"><div class=""><div class="flex flex-row gap-2 items-center"><div class="flex flex-col gap-4"><p>Отлично — <span class="font-semibold">NiceGUI успешно поднялся</span>:</p>
<div class="not-prose flex flex-col"><pre class="text-sm w-full overflow-x-auto dark:bg-zinc-900 p-4 border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-700 rounded-xl dark:text-zinc-50 text-zinc-900"><code class="whitespace-pre-wrap wrap-break-word">NiceGUI ready to go on http://localhost:8080, and http://192.168.1.101:8080
</code></pre></div>
